                StoryPart(4, "A Question Worth Asking", listOf("Their first episode focused on the public library's reduced opening hours. Rather than complain, they interviewed the librarian about staffing and available alternatives.", "They checked dates and service details with the library before recording the segment.", "The episode included a clear way for listeners to send corrections.")),
